This product bundles third-party code:

* src/main/java/io/airlift/compress/v3/zstdFFM - the FFM port of the Zstandard
  codec from the airlift/aircompressor fork at
  https://github.com/ebremer/aircompressor (Apache License 2.0; headers
  retained in each file; local divergences are listed in that directory's
  README.md).
* src/main/java/com/ebremer/ns/GEO.java and GEOF.java - GeoSPARQL vocabulary
  classes derived from Apache Jena (Apache License 2.0; ASF headers retained).
* src/main/java/com/ebremer/beakgraph/core/lib/FrozenNodeCmp.java - Apache Jena
  6.2.0's NodeCmp.compareRDFTerms term order, adapted (Apache License 2.0; ASF
  header retained).
* src/test/java/com/ebremer/beakgraph/rdfarray/UndefSlotsStoreTest.java,
  SequenceQueriesStoreTest.java and ArraySyntaxExamplesStoreTest.java - Apache
  Jena's rdf-array branch tests TestUndefSlots, TestSequenceQueries and
  TestArraySyntaxExamples, ported to BeakGraph stores (Apache License 2.0; ASF
  headers retained).
* src/test/resources/w3c, src/test/resources/sparql-cdts and
  src/test/resources/rdf-array - vendored W3C, SPARQL-CDT and rdf-array contrib
  test suites under their own licenses (see the README.md and LICENSE files in
  those directories).
